actor Guardian
actor Driver
actor Student
actor "device GPS" as GPS

rectangle "P1 authentication" as P1
rectangle "P3 users and families" as P3
rectangle "P4 fleet" as P4
rectangle "P5 routes" as P5
rectangle "P6 schools" as P6
